            <div xml:id="m-517cba2a-2651-43e5-8238-4fb16645a555">
              <lg xml:id="m-b974381e-7faf-4618-bc09-7c0e6bb388b0">
                <l xml:id="m-0cf5672a-a59b-41a4-9fe2-9cd3854227d1" facs="#m-631198f8-2def-496e-82f1-164d47224da4" label="text-like">5th Sunday after the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-9beeebe7-c31a-4448-9867-a2892a6c2ad4" facs="#m-d54a2fc3-5ffa-487c-ba25-a9433c5c6257" label="ambiguous">493</l><l xml:id="m-bec576e6-9445-4a64-b5a6-e28b6274aaeb" facs="#m-7b40049e-9ca5-4127-92bb-b45018cd7b17" label="lyrics-like">fac Dé-us tranquilli-tá-tem. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-d1b0fbac-153a-4150-a95e-9bac2a3bdb91" facs="#m-ec1fd644-a914-4804-b138-35a8b4f572df" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. I. g 2. p. 207.</l><l xml:id="m-ebded17d-cbe6-421b-a730-d4a1474eb8e6" facs="#m-4f8b4a07-86ab-4140-b9b5-e6fc00d7faeb" label="text-like">The Fifth Sunday after the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-c690dd56-9052-496a-968f-dcf308ee92c6" facs="#m-d5c729bf-1481-4b2c-8ae9-19e2be9b3122" label="text-like">As on the third Sunday, except the following</l><l xml:id="m-d7bddd8a-b58e-4e53-b998-e50a4a04e320" facs="#m-a8d3e70c-fd03-42e2-9dcb-68bdf1600c48" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-01e59119-9b73-4e35-9ea4-728acdce4297" facs="#m-59855d75-7080-44ef-8fca-b726d4483dfc" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-e1e5605b-81c7-4782-abff-8b173bda3a88" facs="#m-c4494e08-c1e0-4213-95d9-dfcb6143b9bf" label="lyrics-like">VAmiliam tuam, quaésumus Dó-l caeléstis innítitur, * tua semper pro</l><l xml:id="m-27ca7fb7-3094-41be-9a63-3c9326dca29e" facs="#m-72b49a9b-de7f-4ddd-9b1d-5c2e87fd6910" label="lyrics-like">mine, continua pietáte custó- tectiône muniátur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-80f892ea-b90e-4586-a24f-e26fb86b1b59" facs="#m-6a91af86-ede9-4d8c-b9e3-3183a407092e" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-01de7ce2-b96e-4979-b5a4-26026450c03e" facs="#m-08d4b9b3-1a39-4314-ae65-346f80629285" label="lyrics-like">di : t ut quae in sola spe grátiae</l><l xml:id="m-e46497d7-1b78-47d6-8ae3-d92d7f59f2b1" facs="#m-50854fc5-c402-4694-bb66-ef6a3437857d" label="text-like">Second Collect. A cunctis. p. 498. Third at the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-8a17ae0a-524a-4326-b10f-8b9515e3e822" facs="#m-6368312b-cd41-4af4-9419-7dc79a9350d1" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Colossenses. Col. 3. b.</l><l xml:id="m-0c4f3ddd-9e5c-46d1-b91a-e50b189463e4" facs="#m-3305b708-ace2-49a3-9357-c5d15795616f" label="lyrics-like">LrRatres: Induite vos sicut elécti ! estis in uno córpore : et grati estóte.</l><l xml:id="m-e74404c1-3889-4073-b089-4471c3eb9f93" facs="#m-55965983-5704-417b-83b4-deb05b371388" label="lyrics-like">I Dei, sancti et dilécti, viscera</l><l xml:id="m-0b8968e1-591d-4737-a79d-dd260e120a26" facs="#m-c11a9d80-45ea-46ab-8990-bf1dcdb6282a" label="lyrics-like">Verbum Christi hábitét in vobis</l><l xml:id="m-3c874450-7cb1-4ade-be69-41e90dc004e3" facs="#m-9ab9fd99-647f-4972-802d-b717f3627132" label="lyrics-like">abundánter, in omni sapiéntia, do¬</l><l xml:id="m-d401222b-20b9-44a1-a1c2-745a84582a66" facs="#m-310379a8-00ee-4d4e-901a-ec5b71647aae" label="lyrics-like">misericórdiae, benignitátem, humi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c8c8cb3a-1e92-432a-b037-a8a8e3078189" facs="#m-91fea832-537e-4d4d-b2a2-ff9cba34cd28" label="lyrics-like">céntes, et commonéntes vosmetipsos</l><l xml:id="m-c63e2902-62d9-4973-ab8e-310e556cdf2c" facs="#m-6168ee70-84c6-4f75-8a84-4fb698a2e400" label="lyrics-like">litátem, modéstiam, patiéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-bddf867a-1697-4bc5-b596-a6bf3fb053ff" facs="#m-a5156d42-e564-46cb-be78-123a0969d0ef" label="lyrics-like">psalmis, hymnis, et cánticis spiri¬</l><l xml:id="m-d8e8c9a9-ed02-43d5-a017-f146f23ccce8" facs="#m-842a563d-845e-41de-8b2e-34ab973775b6" label="lyrics-like">supportántes ínvicem, et donántes</l><l xml:id="m-7fb1bb8c-04fd-43ef-9f5b-8860b098f7e0" facs="#m-5f98e3b6-588e-4257-8058-24f88f48640a" label="lyrics-like">tuálibus, in grátia cantántes in cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-10bdd12e-a313-4f85-a3d4-f7139e331659" facs="#m-090e664f-b33e-4a17-9317-b2944ce8db09" label="lyrics-like">vobismetipsis, si quis advérsus áli¬</l><l xml:id="m-14e69892-47c6-41c9-900b-911ebe86d6be" facs="#m-c281e96c-c0d3-4af0-b42b-ef61f3e96179" label="lyrics-like">dibus vestris Deo. Omne quodcúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-65a8fd2f-071e-432b-9f55-5c0d6be0afd5" facs="#m-218c1550-ae57-4bb1-9da9-c2d130aa7b3c" label="lyrics-like">quem habet querélam: sicut et</l><l xml:id="m-d3b291f2-cd87-4096-9e07-5a146477fef3" facs="#m-3a3a1458-336f-49e6-9719-4887367eacca" label="lyrics-like">que fácitis in verbo aut in ópere,</l><l xml:id="m-412af043-77c2-45ec-91d5-05dae8f718ef" facs="#m-12db8f06-e411-40cb-a505-0cd9ba14a835" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus donávit vobis, ita et vos.</l><l xml:id="m-f202bb76-17b0-4b80-a995-7ba9c442816f" facs="#m-65dbd105-08e5-4afb-b671-15f05236c9e4" label="lyrics-like">ómnia in nómine Dómini Jesu Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-ec150814-92c6-4a28-9f22-32666dcbec25" facs="#m-d1d0fe19-fcb5-469b-a6f9-6119ecb61584" label="lyrics-like">Super ómnia autem haec, caritátem</l><l xml:id="m-3b87f228-f07b-4a5e-a536-0509b4f2e74f" facs="#m-5c758517-6d77-4ed3-b140-7937fa6b6cd6" label="lyrics-like">habéte, quod est vínculum perfe- sti, grãtias agéntes Deo, et Patri</l><l xml:id="m-525f1906-3519-4f2e-878c-31e6937968d9" facs="#m-a69691d3-8702-463e-ad34-b5e0546d0957" label="lyrics-like">per Jesum Christum Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-d197aee0-0825-486b-8f0d-77d5ebd6636f" facs="#m-da13466c-22f2-4f91-a552-01e2ca0c9b9b" label="lyrics-like">ctiónis : et pax Christi exsúltet in</l><l xml:id="m-c5b099ee-2780-4703-8d80-73f4aca5f84a" facs="#m-442c4245-1145-4b8c-a796-54b66be3c783" label="lyrics-like">córdibus vestris, in qua et vocáti strum.</l><l xml:id="m-d3135fd8-0339-4d7f-975b-932bb4455721" facs="#m-0c8ffa57-760e-4de4-8f2e-4bca56521710" label="ambiguous">–Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 13. b.</l><l xml:id="m-f765209b-44c4-4dfc-a6c4-b77c011f360b" facs="#m-dd0e36b1-e49a-46bc-a722-f0199337ceef" label="lyrics-like">Nillo témpore: Dixit Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-99db620f-e86e-469c-a765-1ff3a8860f8a" facs="#m-f83b604f-b0a5-401d-91d1-8159bf1ddad1" label="lyrics-like">habet zizánia? Et ait illis: Inimicus</l><l xml:id="m-84cc7f3d-9452-4098-8e4e-8df6c5c07601" facs="#m-09daef96-4d87-4cbd-844f-1bf6e187e9ac" label="lyrics-like">homo hoc fecit. Servi autem dixé¬</l><l xml:id="m-154cc3c1-1b59-4317-a5ec-4e35940675a8" facs="#m-efc7532d-c34f-4870-a315-112af5cf7c4b" label="lyrics-like">L turbis parábolam hanc : Simile</l><l xml:id="m-c09270f9-31e6-4186-a202-743524db2162" facs="#m-06202762-0c11-47ce-8128-50c6c5922aa2" label="ambiguous">runt ei: Vis, imus, et colligimus</l><l xml:id="m-8f0d3264-7b1b-49ce-ad3b-349e67f49b71" facs="#m-b2cbacd0-0f02-4205-b24d-4e58345fced2" label="lyrics-like">factum est regnum caelórum hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-c950f9f8-5b56-45e4-9c0a-90ab4bc5cad0" facs="#m-a2ebf771-486b-406b-b645-91fc9c7f690f" label="lyrics-like">ea? Et ait : Non: ne forte colligén¬</l><l xml:id="m-4727317a-0ed5-4318-93bc-0ae7708ea28f" facs="#m-21a15b4a-79f7-40ba-bffd-2af034f7f365" label="lyrics-like">mini, qui seminávit bonum semen</l><l xml:id="m-b68f2e9e-3209-4c0e-b96f-7d5767af1ca2" facs="#m-99b8c549-6120-4f78-8960-1680ad0fadb2" label="lyrics-like">tes zizánia, eradicétis simul cum</l><l xml:id="m-78f52ebf-58c4-4794-b219-2d623fb2a900" facs="#m-c11ed736-6d34-4136-98a6-7501fa984624" label="lyrics-like">in agro suo. Cum autem dormírent</l><l xml:id="m-f07397f1-2eb9-4958-89c6-9e4dc5dadd00" facs="#m-fbb5ba28-ed9b-40c3-8e52-4e335146c33c" label="lyrics-like">eis et triticum. Sinite útraque</l><l xml:id="m-89e93e04-4207-48bc-aebb-fd8b754a8bea" facs="#m-213d125b-33a7-424d-8e65-18b196d73794" label="lyrics-like">hómines, venit inimícus ejus, et</l><l xml:id="m-e7a4cb75-12fb-404a-9526-2c9f54a69d8b" facs="#m-45cd7432-dc55-4c48-859d-cef8226a88f6" label="lyrics-like">créscere usque ad messem, et in</l><l xml:id="m-68748b0f-f321-405c-affa-0179ab990213" facs="#m-3d8039c6-ac58-4618-8aa0-eac89026b274" label="lyrics-like">superseminávit zizánia in médio</l><l xml:id="m-33cb4ca9-79f8-42a3-9d6b-f6c8e3cb23d6" facs="#m-410fa8bc-1d12-4eca-8957-be537b5d3fe8" label="lyrics-like">tritici, et ábiit. Cum autem crevis¬</l><l xml:id="m-7da30273-cc50-41ef-a556-e6f14006abd8" facs="#m-9709931a-941d-4718-a9c9-62eefda381b6" label="lyrics-like">témpore messis dicam messóribus:</l><l xml:id="m-f52b29fc-463c-4086-925d-9bb241113098" facs="#m-40655b2d-e1c6-4044-9abf-1fe30553f02f" label="lyrics-like">Colligite primum zizánia, et alligáte</l><l xml:id="m-7b7f176a-d58f-4de5-a6c4-22fd501f0eac" facs="#m-c488f4f9-7420-4e8c-9257-52a8f502c29c" label="ambiguous">set herba, et fructum fecisset, tunc</l><l xml:id="m-1522639d-e309-4955-a624-eb88d90820d4" facs="#m-75ba9791-063e-4f5f-bd09-c993b4e4db96" label="lyrics-like">apparuérunt et zizánia. Accedéntes</l><l xml:id="m-a0911abf-cd51-408d-9427-c9a826cd40cf" facs="#m-685f6915-49ae-4d4e-8f55-943c82a16333" label="lyrics-like">ea in fascículos ad comburéndum,</l><l xml:id="m-834d1705-5f54-445d-870d-bfd5f5011983" facs="#m-b47fcaa7-c760-45e6-9109-e704a843d098" label="lyrics-like">autem servi patrisfamilias, dixérunt</l><l xml:id="m-336d343d-41e8-458e-b5b3-dacde5e6897a" facs="#m-98d77452-8eb5-4aef-9a29-fff3d299ef1d" label="lyrics-like">triticum autem congregâte in hór¬</l><l xml:id="m-6719f53b-b41e-4472-9e33-e10b5fbc293c" facs="#m-51ab8fc2-9016-4afd-b53c-dc6d1411ce65" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-d8a3bd92-f89d-4cf8-b559-b440be54ed03" facs="#m-adf7bef3-c797-407a-b661-ffaddfd91b42" label="lyrics-like">ei Dómine, nonne bonum semen</l><l xml:id="m-5f7e0683-411a-4386-b404-9dbdabb5fbbe" facs="#m-ccbb9e80-2591-4993-b066-067ef63ff20e" label="ambiguous">reum meum.</l><l xml:id="m-711ce7da-7030-49ce-aeac-ba8cba43663a" facs="#m-10fb595b-ef19-45a0-b6f1-6b1117f9e8e8" label="lyrics-like">seminásti in agro tuo? Unde ergo</l><l xml:id="m-f0a29800-972c-48ed-ad59-39f08ff6a4b9" facs="#m-ea9420eb-42d8-4a74-aee0-67c1ab335a95" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-93a1e30a-fc49-4e9a-b2de-ae93bde2191d" facs="#m-9558e9cf-e9dc-4b9f-84ff-e2c70c6ac003" label="lyrics-like">K Ostias tibi, Dómine, placatiónis ! miserátus absólvas, et nutántia</l><l xml:id="m-38e38f68-fd5a-4289-9c94-a6a2529b32dc" facs="#m-b46abd9b-94a5-4227-bcbd-610e09af2b42" label="lyrics-like">It offérimus: ut et délicta nostral corda tu dirigas. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-45fecd35-e2b2-48f2-9e39-cd33e50db184" facs="#m-39aadc1b-28e6-480d-8e5d-02c036dfb66f" label="lyrics-like">Second Secret. Exáudi nos. p. 50l. Third at the priest's choice</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>